P7ct&_nc_oc=Adqtu89v15oTVZe7joxjJccjddmZ0yThmYodcnJmcAlBc-dq422sQ0jCDNlCk6yY7CE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8jorGyGYyDxPgShNYJcfs7OQYHayTS5-mXUEj8iKFQ0g&oe=6A466D48"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "708977614588076", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75488375_708977617921409_1075715276216507772_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iQbfBwR9s9sQ7kNvwEkMZNY&_nc_oc=Ado483F3IvHMJBU2mv8nrK2dzmjb9fUsHsyrHO7YpB4xvwH-k9IiBF8iRoJxwMG1oFs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8bOkGiG8H7bXG6s6ZONKVbkiKx0dOD7_6NsMIIb2vhpg&oe=6A465E8A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "1449100632372768", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031502_1449100635706101_8566828919912654030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wLdC-frlzC4Q7kNvwEBhcKY&_nc_oc=Adqzw5rhtCQ94Ycjr_XYd9mwLOAceh0G8RC742FHr11CueJR5AfEU3wkgmIXDXZUGXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-491141jglY7qbOUAk6s9-wU2gDZM5lHDHvcfERfZWsQ&oe=6A465E99"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1042094833579475", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_1042094836912808_4953768684373887112_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zam8k0xVix8Q7kNvwF1HP_i&_nc_oc=AdoJv1X5XXkwsxt957OOAnv0kQrLieF9HWsjipIjaGF9Xfe78TsdjNMe4B3wah3t4Fs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ZxeztDosFMFIt1SO3aSB3tr10PyP7NGoJtecZIDDrGw&oe=6A467580"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_thumb.png", "id": "889483612519314", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974858_889483615852647_6939535896939341857_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HLVVez1CZ9AQ7kNvwHZ5LXj&_nc_oc=Adr25SuxvoPM-SUBdLvTAxHNucko6gEUbs7uQ2IkPVWsZ4dVmZ3oG9dY5oaQkyilk6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_yTMfGryAXlkobq7bnzlR0sUwhsnngiEmZ0zc3x6O3UQ&oe=6A46831B"}, "display_name": "Tabletop Basketball AR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Tabletop Basketball AR\" for Oculus Quest stands out as an avant-garde blend of traditional basketball gameplay and cutting-edge augmented reality (AR) technology. This game offers players an immersive experience that transforms any tabletop into a dynamic 3-on-3 basketball arena. It ingeniously combines the physical skill and strategy of basketball with the interactive capabilities of AR, providing a gaming experience like no other.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Dynamic AR Gameplay: Turn any tabletop into a basketball court with immersive AR technology.\n- Multiplayer Viewing Experience: Join games within the same environment.\n- Intuitive Controls: Designed for Oculus Touch controllers, suitable for all skill levels.\n- Realistic Graphics and Sound: High-quality graphics and immersive sound effects enhance the experience.\n- Regular Updates: Continuous game improvements and new content based on player feedback.\n\t\nWhat sets this game apart is its remarkable use of AR technology. The game transforms any flat surface into a virtual basketball court, allowing players to move around and view the game from multiple angles. This feature not only adds a layer of realism to the gameplay but also brings an innovative twist to the traditional sports gaming genre.", "short_description": "\"Tabletop Basketball AR\" is an Oculus Quest game that merges the excitement of basketball with augmented reality. In this 3-on-3 basketball game, players experience a full-fledged basketball match, enjoying the thrill of the court from a unique, tabletop perspective. The game offers an immersive, interactive experience, combining the strategy and skill of basketball with the innovative technology of AR, perfect for both sports enthusiasts and gamers seeking a novel gaming experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.redzonestudios.com/privacy", "developer_term